[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2582.63, "timestamp": "00:43:02", "text": "星を眺める。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2585.63, "timestamp": "00:43:05", "text": "星座として過ごした長年の間、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2589.59, "timestamp": "00:43:09", "text": "私はきちんと星空を眺めることができなかった。   ああ、ああ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2593.99, "timestamp": "00:43:13", "text": "、ああ。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2596.391, "timestamp": "00:43:16", "author": "@bakononcopiumm", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/hb5sPAHLUD7fBrZZsmfkzISQWwRqI8BY1n8lceyhZz0sNISomD05pCwUe-GL2amD5y-voH_uYw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "You sleep outside?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2604.75, "timestamp": "00:43:24", "text": "芝生の上で星空を眺めることを100％お勧めします。 アニメみたいに、それをやってみたら、最高に最高に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2608.15, "timestamp": "00:43:28", "text": "気持ちよかった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2609.47, "timestamp": "00:43:29", "text": "。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2612.584, "timestamp": "00:43:32", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ahh I have heard the sky there is very noice and clear"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2614.51, "timestamp": "00:43:34", "text": "虫とか何かが体に付かないように気をつけてね。 草むらで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2616.745, "timestamp": "00:43:36", "text": "寝ているとき"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2620.447, "timestamp": "00:43:40", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ya in thw park"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2621.55, "timestamp": "00:43:41", "text": "、わかるでしょ？ それは土だ。 それは地球です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2621.985, "timestamp": "00:43:41", "text": "つまり、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2622.07, "timestamp": "00:43:42", "text": "音楽が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2624.67, "timestamp": "00:43:44", "text": "草に触れるような感じ、わかる？ だから、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2625.87, "timestamp": "00:43:45", "text": "もし彼らが「いや、いや、いや、いや」と言ったら。 私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2628.87, "timestamp": "00:43:48", "text": "ただそこに行って横になり、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2632.23, "timestamp": "00:43:52", "text": "心を落ち着かせ、自分自身と話したり、自分の意識に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2636.47, "timestamp": "00:43:56", "text": "語りかけたり、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2638.51, "timestamp": "00:43:58", "text": "自分の心が何を言っているのかに耳を傾けたりするんです"}]